WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.464 --> 00:00:03.147
Lesson seven. Toys!

2
00:00:04.055 --> 00:00:11.222
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.206 --> 00:00:14.098
Coco, look at my toy box!

4
00:00:14.148 --> 00:00:17.105
Let's open it! One, two, three!

5
00:00:18.303 --> 00:00:21.486
Ball! Say it with me. Ball!

6
00:00:25.486 --> 00:00:28.953
Car! Say it with me. Car!

7
00:00:32.946 --> 00:00:36.229
Doll! Say it with me. Doll!

8
00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.445
Teddy! Say it with me. Teddy!

9
00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:51.132
Blocks! Say it with me. Blocks!

10
00:00:55.109 --> 00:00:58.210
Kite! Say it with me. Kite!

11
00:01:02.201 --> 00:01:07.176
Play with me! Bounce the ball!

12
00:01:07.226 --> 00:01:12.565
Drive the car! Vroom, vroom!

13
00:01:12.615 --> 00:01:16.031
Fly the kite!

14
00:01:16.081 --> 00:01:17.231
Fun!

15
00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:19.057
I have a ball!

16
00:01:19.107 --> 00:01:25.681
I have a kite! What do you have?

17
00:01:25.731 --> 00:01:26.881
Great!

18
00:01:27.678 --> 00:01:29.178
What's in the box?

19
00:01:33.181 --> 00:01:35.714
A teddy! Hello, teddy!

20
00:01:37.716 --> 00:01:44.016
This is G. G is for goat. Goat! G is for girl. Girl!

21
00:01:48.009 --> 00:01:55.015
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

22
00:01:55.065 --> 00:01:56.733
Bye-bye, friends!

